---

This project is a router that orchestrates third-party tools. It does not
vendor their code; `uv` fetches them at run time. Their licences apply to them:

  · firecrawl/pdf-inspector  — MIT         https://github.com/firecrawl/pdf-inspector
  · microsoft/markitdown     — MIT         https://github.com/microsoft/markitdown
  · firecrawl/cli            — MIT         https://github.com/firecrawl/cli
  · pymupdf/PyMuPDF          — AGPL-3.0 (or a commercial licence from Artifex)

Note on PyMuPDF: it is used here only as the reference text layer for the
encoding repair. PyMuPDF is AGPL-3.0. Using it from this MIT-licensed router is
fine for personal and internal use, but if you redistribute a product built on
it, read Artifex's terms first.

Note on the Firecrawl CLI: scraping URLs consumes credits from the Firecrawl
account you authenticate with. That is a paid third-party service, not part of
this project.
